+                     View "pg_catalog.pg_tag_description"
+    Column    | Type | Collation | Nullable | Default | Storage  | Description 
+--------------+------+-----------+----------+---------+----------+-------------
+ oid          | oid  |           |          |         | plain    | 
+ tagid        | oid  |           |          |         | plain    | 
+ tagvalue     | text |           |          |         | extended | 
